m presented to advance the state-of-the-art in sparse convolution for speeding up CNNs.', 'The specific algorithm presented in the text for performing sparse convolution to speed up CNNs.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'SpMDM (Sparse Matrix and Dense Matrix Multiplication)': {'description': ['A computational technique that can be leveraged for fully connected layers.', 'The technique leveraged for implementing fully connected layers, which are implemented as GEMM, to exploit sparsity.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [2]}, 'FC Decay Multiplier 1': {'description': ['A multiplier applied to the weight decay parameter for FC layers.'], 'type': ['method'], 'source_chunk_index': [3]}}
